Assassin axe build that can apply Deep Wound and heavy damage from critical hits, both AoE and single-targeted.

== Attributes and Skills ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=Assassin/Warrior Critical=12+1+3 AxeMastery=12 Tactics=3][Shadow Theft][Cyclone Axe@17][Whirlwind Attack][Dismember@17][Malicious Strike@20][Critical Eye@20][Critical Agility@20][Way Of The Master@20][/build]

[[image:Optional.jpg|25px]] '''Variant skills'''
* {{skill pvxicon|Critical Agility}} is the preferred attack speed increase, but can be swapped if encountering enchantment removal or needing a utility PvE skill.
** {{skill pvxicon|Frenzy}} - Frees up a PvE skill slot but is best used with protective skills.
** {{skill pvxicon|Flail}} - Can be used with an [[gww:of the Warrior|of the Warrior]] mod, in which case it ends fairly quickly even without a cancel stance.
** {{skill pvxicon|Drunken Master|5}} - Powerful IAS/IMS, but requires alcohol for maximum effect.
* {{skill pvxicon|Whirlwind Attack}} - Major source of AoE damage, but can be swapped for a PvE utility if enemy density is low (4-person areas) or adrenaline denial is expected. Otherwise, use the Variant section, or if using Frenzy as an IAS, swap {{skill pvxicon|Malicious Strike}} instead.
** {{skill pvxicon|Asuran Scan}} - Against frequent blindness and blocking.
** {{skill pvxicon|"I Am Unstoppable!"}} - Against frequent knockdowns
* {{skill pvxicon|Wild Blow}} - Stance removal that costs all adrenaline. Always crits, but the relative benefit is small.
</pvxbig>

