== Equipment (Both Builds) ==
* 5x [[gww:Nightstalker's_Insignia|Nightstalker's Insignias]]
* 1x [[gww:Rune of Critical Strikes|Rune of Superior Critical Strikes]]
* 1x Superior [[gww:Rune_of_Vigor|Rune of Vigor]] 
* 2x [[gww:Rune_of_Vitae|Runes of Vitae]] or [[gww:Rune_of_Attunement|Runes of Attunement]], up to player preference

'''Weapons'''

* Primary weapon: [[gww:Furious|Furious]] [[gww:"Guided by Fate"|"Guided by Fate"]] or [[gww:"I have the power!"|"I have the power!"]] Axe [[gww:Enchanting|Of Enchanting]]
** If switching Critical Agility for a different IAS skill, use [[gww:of Defense|Of Defense]] instead
* Secondary weapon: [[gww:Furious|Furious]] [[gww:"Guided by Fate"|"Guided by Fate"]] axe [[gww:Of The Necromancer|Of The Necromancer]]; swap to this axe when more energy is needed.
* Tactics shield [[gww:of Devotion|of Devotion]] with [[gww:"Sheltered by Faith"|"Sheltered by Faith"]]

== Usage ==
<pvxbig>
* Maintain {{skill pvxicon|Critical Eye}}, {{skill pvxicon|Critical Agility}} and {{skill pvxicon|Way of the Master}}.
* Use {{skill pvxicon|Shadow Theft}} to engage. Use it immediately whenever it recharges to upgrade to +6 Axe Mastery.
* Position yourself in melee range of several enemies and spam your AoE attacks: {{skill pvxicon|Triple Chop}}, {{skill pvxicon|Cyclone Axe}}, and {{skill pvxicon|Whirlwind Attack}}.
* Apply {{skill pvxicon|Dismember}} as needed, using it to meet the condition of {{skill pvxicon|Malicious Strike}}.
</pvxbig>

== Counters ==
* Adrenaline denial
* Blind/block
* Enchantment removal or stance removal (depending on IAS)

